Moon rises cleansing sins and swelling ocean --- Evening glows with music and roaming rākṣasas --- Hanumān sees drunken quarrels embraces and sleeping couples --- Hanumān sees handsome and misshapen rākṣasas and star-like wives --- Hanumān scans moon-faced women wearing lightning ornaments --- Hanumān seeks Sītā everywhere among women --- Hanumān fails to find slender Sītā and grieves
